		Finally we apply the orthonormalization Lemma (Lemma~\ref{lem:ortho}) to $\{ \hat{R}^\omega_{a,b} \}$ in order to obtain projective measurements $\{ \hat{L}^\omega_{a,b} \}$ such that on average over $\omega$,
